<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75115" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρκ-ίζω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρκιξέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1126.13
				</span></i>
			 (Delph.) :—like <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρκόω</span> (used with it in <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.278
			</span></i>), <i>make</i> one <i>swear, administer an oath to</i> a
			person, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>; rejected by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				338
			</span></i>, but found in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				4.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.30
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19.278
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				23.172
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				149
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				254.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. ἐφ᾽ ᾧ ἔσται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					684.25
				</span></i>
			 (Dyme, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>) : c. dupl. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. τινὰς ὅρκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(2).1109.52
				</span></i>
			 (Thess., <span class="entity">ii/i B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				5(1).1390.1
			</span></i> (Andania, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ.
				τινά,</span> c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ne.</u>
				5.12
			</span></i> ; <i>adjure,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίμονας,</span> c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.345
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. τινὰ κατὰ τοῦ Θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ch.</u>
					36.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.289
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
				121.242
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρκίζω σε τὸν Θεόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
					5.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.3045
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανὸν ὁρκίζω σε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					299
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. σε τοῖς Μήδων καὶ Περσῶν δόγμασιν
					ἵνα . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Da.</u>
					6.13
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be sworn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡρκισμένοι νόμῳ ἰητρικῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Jusj.</u>
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				38.13.5
			</span></i>.</div>
